        "jsCode": "// Get node-specific static data (persists across workflow runs)\nconst data = $getWorkflowStaticData('node');\n\n// Initialize attempt if it doesn't exist\nif (typeof data.attempt === 'undefined') {\n  data.attempt = 0;\n}\n\n// Increment attempt\ndata.attempt += 1;\n\n// Return updated state for next iteration\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    job_id: $(\"Render Video\").first().json.job_id,\n    attempt: data.attempt // Persist current count\n  }\n}];\n\n"
